# a cell of an unknown type between two hexes: either refused with a
# message, or dropped with the other cells keeping their own attributes
# known: the bad cell is dropped but its attribute row is not, so the hex after it gets the bad cell's attributes
# check: finished
# check: model_or_error out.inp cells_hex.inp
read / avs / hex_bad_type.inp / mo1
dump / avs / out.inp / mo1
finish
